 of the way of …Kxf7.","Black was threatening …Kxf7, winning a rook. The rook steps away.","Black answers 66…Ba4."]}],"opening":{"name":"English Opening: Agincourt Defense","eco":"A13","points":["Both sides followed opening theory up to 6…c5: 12 moves in all, 6 by White and 6 by Black.","Theory runs out after 6…c5: too few games between strong players reached this position to go further."]}}